{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_013_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:baf33441aefab6538878687fe93a612e6bdaac8c8d94c544baa55655476ae11c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff50e8110f0df91b66ad8b7e25c490b263ebc6f3ffbdfc66531577d747682ba0",
      "text": "工作辛苦啦！\n给，这个！是情人节的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e171843317f0e212521b872ac4524bb1d27cfa8b417477d38c92973141c2f3c",
      "text": "上个月的情人节巧克力谢谢你！\n超级好吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:125b77058e3e424b67616dd96113d332ce1178169e404af2150e76feb85aad0e",
      "text": "我想应该没有跟悠介的回礼撞车……\n等会儿拆开看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c85166d5ec77a709e3688a290c950d24500d5e63ee630cc92d21ad19f2f0f85",
      "text": "能把礼物交给你真是太好啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f48f15438208195be9075469a03db073bbd8609c92e2c46271dc9975243816",
      "text": "嘿嘿，送礼物这种事\n还真是会让人稍微有点紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa91fd0b33b7f8a8b0fa0fbd202df5e795e1ed2849a4501fd1c3e33628d005c2",
      "text": "正式开演前打扰你真不好意思，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n我想趁现在先交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15b218c4a1666dcc024a12d1a139b460df2135f1b9f3500b923a50d5fc50aa96",
      "text": "给，白色情人节的礼物！\n请收下♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc9b6c8c57a3f31671c4cf7edbc2e0679b78335526d41dcb2108ffdea57e17e",
      "text": "收到监督送的巧克力，我真的很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12cd5b01d35cc396438030718e52d2410d3cd7e88d99d5acf9c2071be887768c",
      "text": "所以希望能让你高兴，挑选了你可能会喜欢的东西。\n合你的心意就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eb91991fbcd0fb23d87aca60736ee50890712f53e83c00e25cff9f93daac421",
      "text": "啊，可不许当着我的面拆开哦！稍微有点\n难为情，回家之后再拆开看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000037:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c2e50054e404656a204c90a90385931bebe8f278d816f9c1764cb10a0731943",
      "text": "好的。礼物真的非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87eb5437d050f8200379e39b2c96f7cbaa70eb0d52715ff68e3c30975befdaee",
      "text": "挑选了什么样的东西，我很期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140e32f86b0a148fb5f6d538da3a4da7c3d425a8894145a173321045a6a105fd",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你能喜欢太好啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140e32f86b0a148fb5f6d538da3a4da7c3d425a8894145a173321045a6a105fd",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你能喜欢太好啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e30667ea7ad42749b76e2b8ea0c674bee1f318bf285be9afecea582dce181bf2",
      "text": "因为我很想听听监督的感想嘛，拆开了记得告诉我哦。\n约好啰！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_22:5_02_013_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e95248e21c703bef0aeb67b4783ccf5e56c1a39345ce36663c875bd68104852",
      "text": "那么，我去正式演出了！\n要看着我哦！●●●●●●●●●●监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
